      "message": "For now this is fine. But given that we know this now, I think we should do some follow up cleanup to make `third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/vulkan/RefCountedVkHandle.h` automatically assign ids based on types that way we can abstract this detail for all Vulkan handles. That would probably be better going forwards so we never run into a similar issue again. (We should probably also use that helper in more places?)\n\nI think that if we do that cleanup, we should be able to re-simplify the hash operator and just use the ids for the hash value and stuff (and I think we could remove the id handling stuff specific for texture/views we introduced here). Seems like a decent amount of work though, so might be worth filing a bug noting the findings and proposing something along these lines in it and putting it into the backlog.",
